# ==============================================================================
# OK MADAM - Environment Variables Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# Instructions:
# 1. To enable Live Google Maps in MathuraLiveDispatchMap and location autocomplete,
#    obtain an API key from Google Cloud Console (https://console.cloud.google.com/)
# 2. Enable "Maps JavaScript API", "Geocoding API", and "Places API"
# 3. Paste your key below and in your .env file:
#
# VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=AIzaSy...
# ==============================================================================

VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
VITE_APP_MODE=production
VITE_CITY=Mathura
